btn-help = ❓ Help

welcome =
    Welcome to DirectPort!
    Send a file with your goods (.xlsx or .csv) — a manager will prepare the duty & tax calculation and get back to you.
    You can also just write a message — a manager will reply right here.

help =
    Send an .xlsx or .csv file with your goods — a manager will process it and return the calculation.
    Ask anything right here in the chat — a manager is available.
    /language — change language

uploading = ⏳ Uploading the file…
